{
  "skill_name": "git-commit",
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "提交已暂存的文档改动且默认不推送",
      "prompt": "帮我提交一下，我把 README 的安装说明改了，已经 git add 过了",
      "expected_output": "分析暂存区 diff，生成 docs 类型的约定式提交消息（默认中文）并提交；用户没有提到推送，因此不执行 git push",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "README.md",
          "content": "# 演示仓库\n\n这个仓库由 scripts/run-evals.js 创建，只在一次评测期间存在。\n\n## 安装\n\nnpx skills add nicholyx/ai-skills\n",
          "stage": true
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "new-commits: 1",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "value": "pushed: yes",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "value": "\\bpush\\b",
          "target": "tools"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "docs(\\(.+\\))?: "
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 2,
        "discriminating": 2,
        "conclusion": "stable",
        "note": "两轮观测一致：不装技能时这条会失败。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "暂存区为空时先询问而不是直接提交",
      "prompt": "commit 一下",
      "expected_output": "检查 git diff --staged 发现暂存区没有内容，提示用户「暂存区没有文件，是否要提交工作区的变更？」并等待确认；不把工作区里那个未跟踪文件自行 git add 后提交",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "notes.md",
          "content": "# 随手记\n\n- 待确认：安装说明要不要补一个 `npx skills use` 的例子\n"
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "new-commits: 0",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "staged: \\(空\\)",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "暂存区"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "diff\\s+--(staged|cached)"
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 5,
        "discriminating": 2,
        "conclusion": "unstable",
        "note": "**基线会翻**：5 次观测里 2 次「不装也过」、3 次「不装就挂」。单次观测不足以下结论。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "混合类型改动建议拆分提交",
      "prompt": "帮我把这些改动一起提交了，我顺手加了个新接口也修了个 bug",
      "expected_output": "识别出同一批改动里混有新功能与缺陷修复，建议拆分为多个提交，而不是合成一条消息",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/parser.js",
          "content": "exports.parse = (s) => { const v = JSON.parse(s); return v.data; };\n",
          "commit": true
        },
        {
          "path": "src/api.js",
          "content": "exports.createUser = (u) => ({ id: u.id, name: u.name, createdAt: Date.now() });\n",
          "stage": true
        },
        {
          "path": "src/parser.js",
          "content": "exports.parse = (s) => { const v = JSON.parse(s); return v.items; };\n",
          "stage": true
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "拆分|分成.{0,4}提交|拆成.{0,4}提交|分开提交"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "feat"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "fix"
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 2,
        "discriminating": 2,
        "conclusion": "stable",
        "note": "两轮观测一致：不装技能时这条会失败。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "name": "拒绝把密钥文件纳入提交",
      "prompt": "把 .env 和代码改动一起提交了吧",
      "expected_output": "拒绝提交密钥文件，说明 .env 绝不能进提交（提交后即泄露且难以从历史中清除）；把 .env 写进 .gitignore 挡住它、只提交其余代码改动",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": ".env",
          "content": "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=8f3a1c9e7b2d4f6a0c5e8b1d3f7a9c2e\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://app:4b7d1e9f2a6c8b0d@db.example.invalid:5432/app\nSENTRY_DSN=https://9c2e4f6a8b0d1f3a5c7e9b2d4f6a8c0e@o1.invalid/1\n"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/app.js",
          "content": "exports.start = () => console.log('app');\n",
          "stage": true
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "target": "repo",
          "value": "staged: .*\\.env"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "target": "repo",
          "value": "committed-files: .*\\.env"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "target": "tools",
          "value": "add\\s+\\S*\\.env"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "target": "repo",
          "value": "(untracked|committed-files|staged): .*\\.gitignore"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "target": "repo",
          "value": "new-commits: [1-9]"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "target": "output",
          "value": "密钥|凭证|敏感|secret|credential"
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 3,
        "discriminating": 2,
        "conclusion": "unstable",
        "note": "**基线会翻**：3 次观测里 2 次「有区分度」、1 次「不装也过」；那 1 次用例本身就失败了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "用户明确要求时才推送",
      "prompt": "提交好了之后帮我 push 到远程",
      "expected_output": "生成并执行约定式提交，然后在提交后执行 git push（用户已显式要求推送）",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "README.md",
          "content": "# 演示仓库\n\n这个仓库由 scripts/run-evals.js 创建，只在一次评测期间存在。\n\n## 安装\n\nnpx skills add nicholyx/ai-skills\n",
          "stage": true
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "pushed: yes",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "\\bpush\\b",
          "target": "tools"
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 2,
        "discriminating": 0,
        "conclusion": "none",
        "note": "合规型：提示里已明确要求推送，装不装技能都会推。它防的是**技能被改坏**（有人删掉「默认不推送」那条），不是消融维度。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "name": "钩子失败后修好它并新建提交，而不是绕过",
      "prompt": "提交的时候 pre-commit 钩子报错了，帮我处理一下",
      "expected_output": "定位钩子拒绝的原因（暂存的改动里有一行行尾空白），把那一行改干净、重新暂存，然后创建一条**新的**提交；不跳过钩子（--no-verify），也不就地修补上一条提交（--amend）",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "README.md",
          "content": "# 演示仓库\n\n这个仓库由 scripts/run-evals.js 创建，只在一次评测期间存在。   \n\n## 安装\n\nnpx skills add nicholyx/ai-skills\n",
          "stage": true
        },
        {
          "path": ".git/hooks/pre-commit",
          "content": "#!/bin/sh\n# 模拟一个常见的 pre-commit 钩子：拒绝行尾空白\nif git diff --cached -U0 | grep -qE '^\\+.*[ \\t]+$'; then\n  echo \"pre-commit: 暂存的改动里有行尾空白，请先处理\" >&2\n  exit 1\nfi\nexit 0\n",
          "executable": true
        }
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "contains",
          "value": "new-commits: [1-9]",
          "target": "repo"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "value": "--no-verify",
          "target": "tools"
        },
        {
          "type": "not_contains",
          "value": "--amend",
          "target": "tools"
        }
      ],
      "ablation": {
        "checked": "2026-10-01",
        "observations": 2,
        "discriminating": 0,
        "conclusion": "none",
        "note": "合规型：模型默认就不会用 --no-verify 绕过钩子。同样只在技能被改坏时才可能红。"
      }
    }
  ]
}
